<title>BELGIUM: EU Commission forecast for Finland.</title>
<headline>EU Commission forecast for Finland.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for Finland, released on Wednesday:</p>
<p>				     1997	 1998</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		4.4	   3.6</p>
<p> Investment			6.0	   5.1</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)    0.9	   1.4</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	    14.0	  12.9</p>
<p> Public sector deficit	 1.9	   0.6</p>
<p>(pct of GDP)</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		  59.2	  58.6</p>
</text>
